  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<h3>Baseline variants</h3><p>The small FAB is still available, but no longer recommended. <a href=\"/m3/pages/fab/specs#cd336045-e97d-4a6d-ac23-f778fa695e3c\" target=\"_self\">Jump to baseline specs</a></p>"
  },
