    "htmlValue": "<h2>Baseline tokens &amp; specs</h2>"
  },
  {
    "htmlValue": "<p>Use the table's menu to select a token set. This only includes tokens for small and surface FABs, which are both no longer recommended. It doesn't include other colors, or large or regular FABs, since those are still currently used.</p>"
